# i18n & RTL

- No hardcoded UI chrome strings in components — use translation keys from `src/i18n`.
- `LanguageProvider` must set `document.documentElement.lang` and `dir`.
- Use logical CSS (`ms`/`me`/`ps`/`pe`, `start`/`end`) for RTL/LTR.
- Distinguish Arabic translation vs contextual meaning vs English explanation on vocab cards.
- Fuse search must include Arabic fields. Icons stay Lucide (no emoji icons).
- Audit both languages before calling localization complete.
